The THIRD acceptance-smoke re-run
(`docs/experiments/loam-1.0-acceptance-smoke-rerun3.md`) — run against the
sealed close redesign (#166) + variant-B hardening (#167) — confirmed the
redesign's CORE behaviors land on clean inputs (variant B routed
day-derived + zero research; surface-and-check fires) but surfaced THREE
deterministic regressions the role-play sampled this run, all clear-direction
and fixed here (refinements to the same AC families, not new ACs):

  - AC.INTAKE-ECHO.1 — the variant-A opener "Oh, easy — writing listing
    descriptions" distilled to the bare difficulty word "easy" (the em-dash
    clause split left "Oh, easy" as the first clause; lead-filler stripped
    "Oh,"). The proposal read "Help the user reliably easy — …". A
    _PURE_DIFFICULTY guard + an extended _LEAD_FILLER now skip a clause that
    reduces to a difficulty-only fragment and read the next content clause,
    so the distilled item is "writing listing descriptions".
  - AC.ONCLOSE.5 — the variant-B correction OPENED with a bare rejection
    ("Uh — that didn't quite land right, no. What I was saying is the
    claim-summary write-ups…"). The correction branch distilled the
    rejection phrase ("that didn't quite land right, no") into the seed +
    close. _REJECTION_LEAD drops a bare rejection opener and
    _ASSERTED_AFTER_REJECTION pulls the asserted span ("claim-summary
    write-ups") so the close lands the real pain.
  - AC.INTAKE-VACUUM.1 / AC.ONDEEP.1 — the variant-C describe_work answer
    ("I'm a paralegal — discovery requests, cite-checking… but I don't know,
    I can't point to one thing") is a genuine role description with named
    tasks, but the ladder's strict stop/start _looks_empty over-fired on the
    hedging and dropped it to the generic starter — so the opt-in
    deep-research never fired (the AC.SMOKE.3 featherlight expectation for C
    is that research DOES fire on the idea-vacuum-with-role path). The
    describe_work rung now gates on EXTRACTABLE role detail
    (_looks_like_pure_non_answer): a role noun or named task means there is
    content to mine + the opt-in research stays reachable.

Method-level choices (builder's call per ODD §1.1):

  - All three stay deterministic (regex + clause heuristics). Each maps to a
    verbatim rerun3 transcript case now covered by a test; the FOURTH
    acceptance-smoke re-run is the outcome-altitude proof.
  - The describe_work gate distinguishes a PURE non-answer ("I don't know",
    short, no role) from a hedged real description (role + tasks present) —
    the former still routes to the gentle generic starter, the latter mines
    the role + offers the deep dive.

